WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.419 --> 00:00:03.269
Unit seven. Healthy Relationships!

2
00:00:04.228 --> 00:00:07.752
Hello, everyone! I'm Doctor Visal, your school doctor.

3
00:00:07.802 --> 00:00:10.966
Hi, Doctor Visal! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.016 --> 00:00:14.703
Today we learn about Healthy Relationships. Let's go!

5
00:00:15.759 --> 00:00:19.025
Respect. Say it with me. Respect!

6
00:00:22.463 --> 00:00:25.496
Trust. Say it with me. Trust!

7
00:00:29.058 --> 00:00:32.725
Communication. Say it with me. Communication!

8
00:00:36.216 --> 00:00:39.649
Equality. Say it with me. Equality!

9
00:00:43.158 --> 00:00:46.658
Boundaries. Say it with me. Boundaries!

10
00:00:50.142 --> 00:00:53.342
Control. Say it with me. Control!

11
00:00:56.793 --> 00:01:00.193
Jealousy. Say it with me. Jealousy!

12
00:01:03.693 --> 00:01:07.093
Support. Say it with me. Support!

13
00:01:10.606 --> 00:01:20.907
Healthy relationships have respect, trust, communication, and equality. Controlling behaviour and extreme jealousy are warning signs. Partners and friends respect boundaries and support each other.

14
00:01:20.957 --> 00:01:23.609
Now I understand. Thank you, Doctor Visal!

15
00:01:25.030 --> 00:01:30.027
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:30.077 --> 00:01:31.301
Communication!

17
00:01:32.459 --> 00:01:37.689
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:37.739 --> 00:01:38.889
Jealousy!

19
00:01:39.882 --> 00:01:45.439
Did you know? Checking someone's phone or controlling who they see are warning signs of an unhealthy relationship!

20
00:01:45.489 --> 00:01:47.253
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:48.740 --> 00:01:56.352
Think and answer. What are signs of an unhealthy relationship?

22
00:01:56.402 --> 00:01:57.552
Great answer!

23
00:01:58.920 --> 00:02:03.253
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:03.303 --> 00:02:05.784
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

